stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> InReview: submit version
  InReview --> ChangesRequested: reviewer requests edits
  ChangesRequested --> Draft: create revised version
  InReview --> ApprovedForRender: review passes
  Draft --> Withdrawn: withdraw
  InReview --> Withdrawn: withdraw
  ApprovedForRender --> Withdrawn: recall
  note right of ApprovedForRender: Render eligibility does not approve a video for classroom playback.
